  "caveats": "Data sourced from the [European Forest Fire Information System (EFFIS)](https://forest-fire.emergency.copernicus.eu) and [Global Wildfire Information System (GWIS)](https://gwis.jrc.ec.europa.eu), operated by the European Commission's Joint Research Centre (JRC). Original data collections: [EFFIS](https://data.jrc.ec.europa.eu/collection/id-0070) and [GWIS](https://data.jrc.ec.europa.eu/collection/id-0071). Licensed under [CC BY 4.0](https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). Data has been downloaded from EFFIS/GWIS WMS/WFS services and may constitute derivative data.",
